# BUILD PAIRARENA AI — A COMPLETE FULL-STACK CODING, LEARNING & LIVE INTERVIEW PLATFORM

Act as a senior full-stack engineer, software architect, UI/UX designer, AI engineer, database engineer, and security specialist.

Build a complete, production-minded web application named **PairArena AI**.

PairArena AI is an all-in-one platform combining:
1. Live collaborative coding interviews.
2. A multi-language online compiler and code editor.
3. DSA practice, coding challenges, contests, and assessments.
4. Structured learning paths for DSA, full-stack development, AI/ML, GenAI, RAG, system design, and computer science fundamentals.
5. AI tutoring powered by the Gemini API.
6. Learning resources and relevant YouTube recommendations.
7. Performance analytics, session recordings, and downloadable PDF reports.
8. User accounts, personalized dashboards, saved progress, and revision tools.

This must be a real, functioning full-stack application, not a static landing page, UI prototype, or collection of non-functional buttons.

IMPORTANT: Prioritize a working end-to-end core product. Implement features in coherent phases, but do not silently replace missing integrations with fake data or pretend that an unfinished feature works.

